 plats and surveys begin in the 1800’s. Surveys are referenced by the nam
 es of the owners\, the surveyor\, and the town in which the land is locate
 d. The Register of Deeds is an elected position in Piscataquis County gove
 rnment and the term of office is four years. Registry office hours are 8:3
 0am to 4:00pm\, Monday — Friday.\n  - The digital indices and images may
  be viewed at no cost on:\n  - www.maineregistryofdeeds.com\n  - . Click o
